WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:04.999
Ivy walked into the mess hall for lunch.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.541
Ezra and Glen looked surprised when she got into the food line with them.

3
00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:14.332
"You're out of the infirmary!" Glen said. "This is great!"

4
00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:20.063
"What happened?" Ezra asked. "I thought you'd stay there forever."

5
00:00:20.064 --> 00:00:22.018
Ivy rolled her eyes.

6
00:00:22.019 --> 00:00:25.802
"Nurse Kramer figured out I was faking it.

7
00:00:25.803 --> 00:00:30.229
I guess I'll be doing the stupid canoe race after all."

8
00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:33.021
Ezra and Glen high-fived each other.

9
00:00:33.022 --> 00:00:36.166
"Yippee for Yellow!" Glen yelled.

10
00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:41.416
Ivy raised one eyebrow. "'Yippee for Yellow'?"

11
00:00:41.417 --> 00:00:46.332
"It's our team cheer," Glen said. "Pretty cool, huh?"

12
00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:51.416
Ivy sighed. "Pretty awful."

13
00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:56.707
The kids took their trays to a table and sat down.

14
00:00:56.708 --> 00:00:59.715
Ivy put down her backpack.

15
00:00:59.716 --> 00:01:05.042
"Instead of coming up with a cheer, you should have been practicing."

16
00:01:05.043 --> 00:01:09.341
"The Blue team doesn't have Annie anymore," Ezra said.

17
00:01:09.342 --> 00:01:14.313
"So Glen thinks we can beat them. Maybe he's right."

18
00:01:14.314 --> 00:01:20.374
"Now you're talking!" Glen raised his glass of bug juice and took a drink.

19
00:01:20.375 --> 00:01:24.979
"But what about the Red team?" Ezra bit his lip.

20
00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:32.062
"They're really fast too. I'm worried we don't have a chance against them."

21
00:01:32.063 --> 00:01:35.142
"Don't be so negative," Glen said.

22
00:01:35.143 --> 00:01:37.138
"We just need to practice.

23
00:01:37.139 --> 00:01:43.670
Like all day, every day." He bit into his slice of pizza.

24
00:01:43.671 --> 00:01:52.332
"Right." Ezra nodded. "Practice all day, every day—for the next ten years."

25
00:01:52.333 --> 00:01:58.041
"I have an idea," Ivy said. "What if we cheat?"

26
00:01:58.042 --> 00:02:00.138
The boys stared at her.

27
00:02:00.139 --> 00:02:05.978
"Cheat?" Ezra said. "I don't think so, Ivy.

28
00:02:05.979 --> 00:02:10.430
We'd be mad if the other teams won by cheating."

29
00:02:10.431 --> 00:02:17.460
"Well, I think it's a great idea," Glen said. "What should we do?"

30
00:02:17.461 --> 00:02:20.590
Ivy thought as she took a bite of pizza.

31
00:02:20.591 --> 00:02:27.207
"Yuck! This is the greasiest pizza I've ever tasted."

32
00:02:27.208 --> 00:02:30.832
"That's it!" Glen's eyes lit up.

33
00:02:30.833 --> 00:02:34.655
"Let's grease the other teams' paddles with our pizza slices.

34
00:02:34.656 --> 00:02:40.374
Their paddles will be so slippery, they'll drop them. And we'll win!"

35
00:02:40.375 --> 00:02:45.916
Glen grabbed the pizza slices from Ivy's and Ezra's plates.

36
00:02:45.917 --> 00:02:49.960
"Hey, I'm still hungry!" Ezra said.

37
00:02:49.961 --> 00:02:53.666
"You shouldn't eat so much," Glen said.

38
00:02:53.667 --> 00:03:01.824
"And you need to save room for your Colossal Cone." He glanced around.

39
00:03:01.825 --> 00:03:05.472
"We have to sneak this pizza down to the lake somehow."

40
00:03:05.473 --> 00:03:11.112
Suddenly he spotted Ivy's backpack.

41
00:03:11.113 --> 00:03:13.583
"No way!" Ivy said.

42
00:03:13.584 --> 00:03:19.381
"You are not putting pizza in my backpack. My sketch pad is in there!"

43
00:03:19.382 --> 00:03:22.310
But Glen grabbed it anyway.

44
00:03:22.311 --> 00:03:24.922
Ivy leaped up to pull it away.

45
00:03:24.923 --> 00:03:28.624
The two of them tugged back and forth on the backpack.

46
00:03:28.625 --> 00:03:31.973
"Glen, stop it," Ezra said.

47
00:03:31.974 --> 00:03:36.745
"Greasing the other teams' paddles isn't a good idea."

48
00:03:36.746 --> 00:03:39.013
Glen let go and frowned.

49
00:03:39.014 --> 00:03:44.044
"Do you have a better idea? I'm trying to get us ice cream.

50
00:03:44.045 --> 00:03:50.916
Four scoops of ice cream! With six toppings!"

51
00:03:50.917 --> 00:03:54.561
Wes Wheezer blew his bugle for the end of lunch.

52
00:03:54.562 --> 00:03:57.917
The kids carried their trays to the pans for washing.

53
00:03:57.918 --> 00:04:00.624
Then they walked out to the porch.

54
00:04:00.625 --> 00:04:05.545
Ivy wanted to check her mail, but the Ucks came charging toward them.

55
00:04:05.546 --> 00:04:11.826
Buck tossed a basketball, and Huck jumped up to catch it. He crashed into Ivy.

56
00:04:11.827 --> 00:04:15.499
"Hey, watch it!" she yelled.

57
00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:18.990
"Why don't you watch it!" Huck said.

58
00:04:18.991 --> 00:04:23.979
"We need to practice for the free-throw event. So stay out of our way."

59
00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:26.156
The Ucks ran off.

60
00:04:26.157 --> 00:04:30.505
Ivy scowled. "I can't stand those Ucks.

61
00:04:30.506 --> 00:04:33.214
Too bad they're not in the canoe race.

62
00:04:33.215 --> 00:04:36.935
They're so big, their canoe would sink!"

63
00:04:36.936 --> 00:04:47.625
"Hmm." Ezra scratched his chin. "I think I just got an idea of how we could win."

